<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Version vectors</strong=
> for cache entries to handle out-of-order updates</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Checksum validation</st=
rong> for critical financial data</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Graceful degradation</s=
