<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key insight for NAB</str=
ong>: We can't rely solely on cache TTL for financial data. <strong>Event-d=
riven invalidation</strong> with <strong>cross-device synchronization</stro=
ng> ensures users see consistent data regardless of how they access their a=
ccounts.</p>
